@startuml cgms_fault_handling
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title CGMS Fault Handling Architecture

component Sensor
component Firmware
component FaultManager
component AlertLogic
component User

Sensor --> Firmware : abnormal data
Firmware --> FaultManager : fault detected
FaultManager --> AlertLogic : fault state
AlertLogic --> User : sensor error alert

note right of FaultManager
Fault Types:
- Sensor drift
- Signal saturation
- BLE timeout
end note

note bottom of AlertLogic
Regulatory:
ISO 14971 Risk Control
end note

@enduml
